  "thesis": {
    "NVDA": "Core AI GPU/accelerator platform leadership | strengthening",
    "ASML": "Sole-source EUV lithography. THESIS DENTED not broken 2026-07-28: China began mass-producing immersion DUV, first units to SMIC/Hua Hong/CXMT. Scale is tiny (5 units 2026, ~20 in 2027 vs ASML's 131 immersion tools in 2025 and 98.7% share), still needs Japanese components, and does NOT touch EUV -- which is the actual moat | watch",
