    "CLS": "EMS/contract manufacturer building Broadcom/OpenAI custom AI ASICs (Jalapeno) + AI server hardware | strengthening",
    "DRAM": "Thematic memory ETF -- holds the exact names CXMT now competes with (Samsung, SK Hynix, Micron) | watch",
    "VRT": "Thermal/power management (cooling, UPS) for AI datacenters | strengthening",
    "AVGO": "Custom AI ASICs (XPUs) and networking silicon for hyperscalers | strengthening",
    "MRVL": "Custom AI silicon and optical interconnect for hyperscalers; Nvidia/Trainium partnership, record revenue | strengthening",
    "EWY": "South Korea ETF: >50% Samsung + SK Hynix. On 2026-07-28 Samsung fell 14.4% (worst since Oct 2008) and SK Hynix 14.7%; KOSPI -10.84%, -34% in 25 days after a 300% spike | watch",
    "CIEN": "Optical networking gear for AI datacenter/telco backbone -- trimmed 59%, weak FY guide vs AI PoC win | watch",
    "QCOM": "Diversifying from handsets into AI/datacenter CPUs and auto | strengthening",
    "TER": "Semicap automated test equipment geared to AI chip test volume | strengthening",
    "TSM": "Foundry monopoly manufacturing leading-edge AI chips | strengthening",
    "MU": "Memory (DRAM/HBM). THESIS THREAT 2026-07-28: CXMT listed on Shanghai STAR (+400% debut) -- China's domestic DRAM champion is now publicly capitalised, on top of HBM3E ASP -51% from peak. Named, funded competitor where there was none | watch",
    "SNDK": "AI NAND/enterprise-SSD supercycle. Same CXMT capitalisation threat as MU; highest beta in book (2.464) and 1.6x its risk cap | watch",
    "AMAT": "Semicap deposition/etch equipment for AI chip fabs (position cut to dust, 0.012% weight -- sizing only, thesis unaffected) | strengthening",
    "COHR": "Photonics/optical components for datacenter interconnect | strengthening",
    "ARM": "Chip architecture/IP licensing powering most AI silicon | watch",
