    "ORCL": "Oracle Cloud Infrastructure -- hyperscaler cloud/AI-capex beneficiary | watch",
    "GOOG": "Hyperscaler that BUYS AI capex rather than selling it -- the chain's only internal hedge; blowout 2Q26 print, no earnings until ~late Oct | strengthening [POSITION CLOSED 2026-07-28, swapped to GOOGL Class A]",
