    "NBIS": "Neocloud GPU-as-a-service; Nvidia 9.3% stake + contract-backed debt raise | strengthening",
    "IREN": "Bitcoin-mining infra pivoted to AI/GPU cloud; $2.8B contracted AI cloud revenue | strengthening",
    "BE": "On-site fuel-cell power for AI datacenters (Oracle/Brookfield partnerships, $20B backlog) | strengthening",
    "GLW": "Optical fiber/connectivity + specialty glass for AI datacenter interconnect (Nvidia partnership) | watch",
    "MKSI": "Semicap vacuum/laser/photonics & process-control tools for leading-edge + memory fab capex | intact",
